Sample document
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

samples/freigabe_antragsteller_auto.docx is a placeholder administrative letter
template. Authority name, addresses, telephone numbers, bank details, file
reference, document properties, logo and the body text of the letter are all
made up; the logo is a generated placeholder mark. What the file keeps from the
document it was built from is its structure -- the VML shapes in the header, the
hanging indent, the multiple line spacing -- which is what this project is about.
See the "Anonymisierung" section of README.md.
